        <Literal xml:lang="en">A work of visual arts and performing arts, including musical works; dramatic works; pantomimes and choreographic works; motion picture and other audiovisual works; pictorial, graphic, sculptural and architectural works. Adapted from Law Insider: https://www.lawinsider.com/dictionary/artistic-works</Literal>
